{"game": "warframe", "language": "english", "appid": 230410, "month": "2018-09", "window": 3, "start_date": 1537056000, "end_date": 1537660799, "month_true_total": 1038, "quota": 5, "returned": 5, "pulled_at": "2026-09-14 18:57:57 Pacific Daylight Time", "reviews": [{"recommendationid": "44879207", "author": {"steamid": "76561198263134434", "personaname": "Tetrilord", "persona_status": "online", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198263134434/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 50, "playtime_forever": 735, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 735, "last_played": 1535065732, "avatar": "c4068ffe55af88f725c6aa9ae54b0fda4430aa0f"}, "language": "english", "review": "I am a new player to the world that is Warframe. Why I never gave this game much thought is beyond me but after playing it I am stunned by how good it is. \n\npros\n\n-Stunning visuals\n-play solo or play with friends\n-kind and respectful community (random/advanced players will give new players good/OP equipment and booster items instead of selling them)\n-smooth, fast-paced combat thats easy to learn\n-thousands of weapon types\n-dozens of warframes (classes) that give you new gameplay experience and skills\n-fight/move on the ground, on walls or in the air\n-hundreds of missions and quests\n-stable servers enable smooth multiplayer gameplay\n- ITS FREE!!!\n\ncons\n\n-story gets confussing and or non-existant as you progress through the game\n-warframes can only be unlocked via platnum (which requires real money) or a blu-print for a specific warframe and 3 parts (head, chassi and powersource) to make said warframe\n-missions/destinations are not marked on the map (meaning you have to find its location and sometimes the mission is in a locked part of the map)\n-missions that reward you with warframe parts are also not marked on the map (recommend looking up missions and their locations)\n-not all players are nice\n-you can only level up if your weapons have reached a set level (and the process is long and very slow) and you cannot use higher level items unless you are a higher level character\n\nIf you like playing with friends and or fast-paced games then go on and play", "timestamp_created": 1537647198, "timestamp_updated": 1540653005, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 2, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.533073961734771729", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1364234640", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "44878321", "author": {"steamid": "76561198133052749", "personaname": "Penjamin Netanyahu", "persona_status": "online", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/Cr1pppy/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 7, "playtime_forever": 185399, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 82396, "last_played": 1786313982, "avatar": "e254b10b644583b7faeb46ac75a80255b1195f67"}, "language": "english", "review": "Its alright", "timestamp_created": 1537643885, "timestamp_updated": 1537643885, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 1, "votes_funny": 2, "weighted_vote_score": "0.523809552192687988", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1364234640", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "44877410", "author": {"steamid": "76561198031626467", "personaname": "beew", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/kkbon/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 25, "playtime_forever": 59621, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 50594, "last_played": 1754028493, "avatar": "10baeca62a867479fb5c2f1879d91aee46406095"}, "language": "english", "review": "good", "timestamp_created": 1537640459, "timestamp_updated": 1537640459, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 1, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "com